        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Compound Upsilon... every player puts h-2 ongoing/equip cards from their play area back in their hand, or h-2 from the total number of heroes, meaning it gets split amongst everyone playing?\r\n\r\nFollow-up that I just thought of... I was assuming this meant remove from play and back to hand, which is detrimental.  Any chance it's supposed to mean from trash back to hand, which could be highly beneficial (perhaps to offset the increase of spite's dmg dealt)?\r\n\r\nThanks!",
