        "created_at": "2013-01-25T00:44:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks Ameena!  Totally played it thinking everybody had to put h-2 back. Still came out victorious, but probably made it harder than it had to be.</p>\n<p>I figured it was wishful thinking that the card meant pull from trash.</p>\n<p>I am slowly learning to thoroughly read every card!</p>\n<p>Appreciate the response jaymann, but that left me more confused than I started!</p>",
